{"id":"93a1a0c23b497985","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Cofinal Subset","display":"df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset — ZFC Order2 Cofinal Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset","58-df-zfc-order6-cofinal-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset — ZFC Order2 Cofinal Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-cofinal-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset — ZFC Order2 Cofinal Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(C,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CofinalSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CofinalSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cofinality is expressed through ordered-pair membership in the declared order relation.</li>\n<li>The order6 cofinal-subset variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CofinalSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CofinalSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)","display":true}],"bytes":1172,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2926","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset.md|58-df-zfc-order2-cofinal-subset]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}